                <pb facs="0274" n="190" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg190"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Beaupré to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-09-01"><hi rendition="#italic">September 1,
                        1903</hi></date>.<lb/>(Received through German embassy September
                        5.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have not received Department’s messages, while others of late date for various
                    legations have-arrived. I have sent important telegrams 30 and 31. On receiving,
                    answer by German minister.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
